SUMMARY:Blues & Brews: A Thanksgiving Eve Party With Mr Jimmy
DESCRIPTION:Kick off your Thanksgiving festivities with a little blues\, cold brews\, and good vibes!\nNothing says holiday kickoff like great music\, cold drinks\, and even better company! Join us for a night of soulful live blues with Mr Jimmy\, holiday drink specials\, 20% off all Devil’s Foot soda cases and plenty of reasons to celebrate. \nFree to attend. \nWe’ll see you there!
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/blues-brews-a-thanksgiving-eve-party-with-mr-jimmy/
CATEGORIES:Family Friendly,Free & Fun!,Live Music
